and `chunk_summary_brief` work items and states.\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:38:- Smart compact recovery through `turns.compactChunkMaterial`.\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:42:- Background chunk-summary requeue/wait behavior for not-ready member `lower_band_projection`.\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:54:**AC-4.1:** A closed chunk's detailed and brief summaries are derived as two independent work items with independent states.\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:57:  - Given: a chunk closes\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:65:**AC-4.2:** At compact, a chunk summary that is not ready (`pending` or `failed`) resolves through `turns.compactChunkMaterial` to a deterministic stored-member concatenation; compact makes no provider call and does not re-derive the summary.\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:72:**AC-4.3:** When a chunk summary still cannot be made ready, compact falls back to a deterministic concatenation of the chunk's member content (uncompressed) rather than leaving a gap.\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:75:  - Given: a chunk summary that is not ready at compact time\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:82:  - Given: a compact performs a chunk-summary fallback\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:93:  - Given: multiple missing/failed chunk summaries\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:97:  - Given: canonical source for a chunk's turns is corrupt\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:101:**AC-4.6:** Smart compact performs no provider calls at all; background chunk derivation performs no provider work inside a DB write transaction.\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:104:  - Given: a compact over a thread with not-ready chunk summaries, provider spy installed\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:111:  - Given: a compact falls back to concatenation for a chunk\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:113:  - Then: a log entry records the chunk, derivation type, reason, and fallback\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:115:**AC-4.8:** Background chunk-summary derivation behaves differently from compact-time recovery when a member `lower_band_projection` is not ready: because no consumer is waiting, it **requeues and waits** for the input rather than concatenating or failing. It blocks (no progress) only on source corruption of a member; a not-ready member input degrades to a requeue, never a hole or a terminal failure.\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:118:  - Given: a chunk summary derives in the background while a member `lower_band_projection` is `pending`\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:120:  - Then: the chunk summary work requeues (waits) rather than concatenating or landing `failed`\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:123:  - When: the background chunk summary attempts to derive\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:131:Story 4 owns the chunk and compact recovery boundary. Background chunk-summary derivation waits for member `lower_band_projection` inputs because no consumer is waiting. Compact is a consumer path and never calls a provider; it asks the turns surface for ready summary material or deterministic stored-member concatenation.\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:152:| Background chunk summary | `packages/lhc/src/domains/turns/internal/chunks.ts` |\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:154:| Chunk fallback assembly | `packages/lhc/src/domains/turns/internal/chunk-recovery.ts` (NEW per tech design) |\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:158:| Story tests | `packages/lhc/test/chunk-compact-recovery.test.ts` (planned) |\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:166:- [tech-design.md §Compact chunk material interface](/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/tech-design.md:226), lines 226-236\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:167:- [tech-design.md §Compact chunk material mechanics](/Users/leemoore/code/pi-long-horizon/liminal-context/docs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/tech-design.md:283), lines 283-295\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:175:| TC-4.1a | `packages/lhc/test/chunk-compact-recovery.test.ts` | Chunk close queues detailed and brief summaries as separate work items. |\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:176:| TC-4.1b | `packages/lhc/test/chunk-compact-recovery.test.ts` | Detailed and brief summary states can diverge independently. |\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:177:| TC-4.2a | `packages/lhc/test/chunk-compact-recovery.test.ts` | Failed detailed summary at compact returns stored-member concat through `compactChunkMaterial` and zero provider calls. |\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:178:| TC-4.3a | `packages/lhc/test/chunk-compact-recovery.test.ts` | Unready summary yields deterministic concat band entry with no missing span. |\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:179:| TC-4.4a | `packages/lhc/test/chunk-compact-recovery.test.ts` | Compact fallback emits visible warning naming what fell back. |\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:180:| TC-4.4b | `packages/lhc/test/chunk-compact-recovery.test.ts` | Stop request during fallback assembly halts without corrupting thread. |\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:181:| TC-4.5a | `packages/lhc/test/chunk-compact-recovery.test.ts` | Multiple missing/failed summaries complete compact with concat fallbacks. |\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:182:| TC-4.5b | `packages/lhc/test/chunk-compact-recovery.test.ts` | Corrupt canonical source makes `compactChunkMaterial` return blocked and compact refuse with `state_corruption`. |\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:183:| TC-4.6a | `packages/lhc/test/chunk-compact-recovery.test.ts` | Compact over not-ready summaries records zero provider calls for the entire compact. |\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:184:| TC-4.7a | `packages/lhc/test/chunk-compact-recovery.test.ts` | Compact concat fallback writes log entry with chunk, derivation type, reason, and fallback. |\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:185:| TC-4.8a | `packages/lhc/test/chunk-compact-recovery.test.ts` | Background chunk summary requeues with `member_projection_not_ready`, not concat/failed/provider failure. |\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:186:| TC-4.8b | `packages/lhc/test/chunk-compact-recovery.test.ts` | Member turn source corruption surfaces instead of looping or fabricating. |\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:19