recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:215:- Evidence: `packages/lhc/test/chunk-compact-recovery.test.ts` runs compact with `spyProvider` and `cd packages/lhc && pnpm run boundaries` proves thread-view uses the turns surface, never internals.\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:219:- Targeted: `cd packages/lhc && pnpm run test -- test/chunk-compact-recovery.test.ts`\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:234:- Background chunk-summary derivation requeues on not-ready member `lower_band_projection`.\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:324:### Flow 4 — Chunk Derivation and Compact Recovery → `test/chunk-compact-recovery.test.ts`\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:328:| TC-4.1a | 4.1 | chunk closes | detailed + brief = two separate work items |\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:337:| TC-4.7a | 4.7 | compact falls back to concat | log entry: chunk, derivation type, reason, fallback |\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:338:| TC-4.8a | 4.8 | background chunk summary, member `lower_band_projection` `pending` | summary work requeues (waits) with reason `member_projection_not_ready` — not concat, not `failed`, not a provider-failure reason |\ndocs/specs/01-lhc-sdk/06-derivation-recovery/artifacts/04-chunk-derivation-compact-recovery/story-lead/prompts/001-planner-turn-003.md:388:| 4 — chunk/compact recovery | background-wait +